<speak>All right, let me put the relevant particulars on the table first. The holding I want you to transact in is Atlas <sub alias="you ess dee">USD</sub> Corporate Bond 2031. My instruction is to sell from my existing holding. For this transaction, please use <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars as the transaction currency. I have had the older paperwork in a folder at home for quite a while. When I prepared for this conversation, I found some notes in my own handwriting, but also several unrelated letters tucked behind them. That is very typical of me: I keep the paper, but I do not always keep it in the right place. My wife suggested I use proper dividers rather than relying on the colour of an envelope. I think I will finally take that advice.</speak>